Your Radiance is so powerful it burns all foes caught in it, dealing [20, 27, 32, 36, 40 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage to all foes caught inside every turn.

Each enemy effected has a [5%, 12%, 17%, 20%, 22% (TL1-5)] chance of being dazed and blinded by the light for 3 turns. The daze and blind can be applied to each enemy at most once every 7 turns.

The damage increases with your Spellpower.
